    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Devoted of Ynnead",
    "summary": "When the opponent’s [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) ends, check whether it cost you any YNNARI units. If so, choose one of your YNNARI INFANTRY or YNNARI MOUNTED units within 6 inches of a YNNARI unit lost during that phase. The response is optional and uses a Normal move with a D6+1 inch limit. You can modify one YNNARI Fade Back Agile Manoeuvre per turn. Swap its Normal move for a [Surge move](vsdata:core-rule/surge-move) capped at D6+1 inches. As the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) opens, choose a YNNARI unit that is below Starting Strength and lacks the TITANIC keyword. It gets [Fights First](vsdata:core-ability/fights-first) for that phase.",
